      "message": "docs(process): bring the PR-reviewer agent up to today's review practice\n\n- The agent sets the PR's review label itself (merge-ready / needs-rework /\n  conflicts / needs-maintainer, per review-prs step 2b) and removes the\n  others, so every reviewed PR is visible on the PR list; a new step 7 says\n  how, including our own PRs going back to draft on red or orange.\n- Worktrees live under .claude/worktrees/ (AGENTS.md), each with its own\n  CARGO_TARGET_DIR; cleanup removes the target too.\n- A dispatcher-named per-PR lock (.claude/pr-review-<N>.lock) is honoured\n  for side-by-side reviews; only your own lock is ever deleted.\n- Builds and tests run in the foreground with a timeout: several reviews\n  stalled waiting on background runs that had already died.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
